---
import Section from './Section.astro'

const pressures = [
  {
    title: 'Clouds multiply',
    body: 'New platforms create opportunity. They also add more points of connection.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Legacy remains essential',
    body: 'Critical systems cannot simply be switched off. Progress must work with what is already in place.',
  },
  {
    title: 'The whole system is harder to see',
    body: 'As environments grow, risk is harder to see. So is the impact of change.',
  },
]
---

<Section
  eyebrow="Why Progress Gets Hard"
  heading="When the whole system is hard to see, every change carries more risk."
  body="The technology may already be in place. But cloud, legacy systems, suppliers and teams can still make change hard."
  theme="light"
>
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    {
      pressures.map((pressure, index) => (
        <article class="border border-frontier-light-grey bg-frontier-white p-8">
          <div
            class:list={[
              'mb-6 h-1 w-16 rounded-full',
              index === 0 && 'frontier-gradient-green-cyan',
              index === 1 && 'frontier-gradient-cyan-blue',
              index === 2 && 'frontier-gradient-cyan-purple',
            ]}
          />

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-frontier-dark">
            {pressure.title}
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-frontier-mid-grey">
            {pressure.body}
          </p>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-frontier-mid-grey">
    Nothing is wrong in isolation. Together, it can slow progress.
  </p>
</Section>
